        NEW: "全新", USED: "二手", REFURBISHED: "翻新", OPEN_BOX: "开箱品",
        OFFICIAL: "官方", AUTHORIZED_RETAILER: "授权零售商", ESTABLISHED_RETAILER: "成熟零售商", RISKY: "风险商家",
        INDEPENDENT: "独立验证", UNVERIFIED: "未验证",
